--- !u!114 &1620022758
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1620022756}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0dff2782361cb9d428a50273270cd055, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  outcomeData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5c8fbb47286e4d3459d7fd16089de6c2, type: 2}
  choiceType: 5
  responseText: {fileID: 1561475157}
  PlayerResponses:
  - "You either join us or survive on your own\u2026 your choice."
  - "I don\u2019t have time for strangers wandering alone. Join us, or don\u2019t."
  - "It\u2019s dangerous out here. You can stick around or get eaten."
  - We move together or not at all. Join, or stay behind.
  - "We\u2019re stronger as a group. Don\u2019t die out there trying to be solo."
  - "I know it\u2019s hard to trust, but we could watch each other\u2019s backs."
  - "You don\u2019t have to face this alone. Come with us."
  - "I\u2019ve been alone too\u2026 it helps to have someone at your side."
  - "It\u2019s scary out there. We can help each other survive."
  - "If you want, there\u2019s a place with us. You don\u2019t have to fight alone."
  - "We\u2019ve got room. Come with us and stay safe."
  - "You\u2019re not alone anymore. Join our group."
  - "We\u2019ll share what we have\u2026 safety in numbers."
  - "It\u2019s easier together than alone. You can join us."
  - "We won\u2019t leave anyone behind. Come along."
  - "We\u2019re going. You can come if you want."
  - "Group\u2019s leaving soon. Stay or join, your call."
  - "No pressure\u2026 you can tag along if it makes sense."
  - "I\u2019m heading out. You\u2019re welcome to come."
  - We stick together. You in or out?
  - "Look, I don\u2019t have the energy to fight alone. Come with us."
  - "I\u2019ve seen enough. Join us or do what you want."
  - "We can move faster together\u2026 or you can keep wandering."
